@;@ RHP_name: The Mushroom Patch (02/08/99)
@;@ For: The L.O.R.D. Cavern v1.3c+
@;@ Written_by: Michael Everett
@;@ Gold reward capped at 1000 flat (was 1000*LEVEL - too exploitable at high levels)
@;@@PROGRAM@ LORDCAVE
@;@@VERSION@ 1.3c

`6You find a tunnel with strange
`6mushrooms all over the walls.

`$Investigate further?
@YESNO@
@##N

`%You leave the tunnel and the mushrooms.
@END@

@##Y

`6What would you like to investigate?
  `$(`6P`$)`6ick a mushroom
  `$(`6S`$)`6mell a mushroom
  `$(`6T`$)`6aste a mushroom
@PROMPT@ PTS
@##P
@CLEAR@

`6You decide to pick a mushroom.
`6After placing it carefully in
`6your sachel you decide to leave
`6the mushroom patch.

`$After a while your sachel becomes
`$much much heavier.  You notice the
`$mushroom has turned to gold.

@GOLD@ 1000

`6If only you could find
`6that mushroom patch again!
@END@
@##S
@CLEAR@

`6The smell of the mushroom
`6envigorates your body, you
`6now have more energy.
@SEARCH@ +2

@END@
@##T
@CLEAR@

`6You are very hungry and
`6these mushrooms look tasty!

`$After taking only a small bite
`$you become weak and quickly leave
`$the mushroom patch.

`6You vow never to do that again.
@SEARCH@ -1
@END@
